        <mxCell id="why" value="&lt;b&gt;Why two stacks and not one:&lt;/b&gt; the Helm provider needs the cluster endpoint at plan time, so Cilium and Flux cannot be planned in the same apply that creates the cluster. Stage 1 brings nodes Ready on VPC-CNI; Stage 2 deletes it and hands networking to Cilium." style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="856" width="900" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hand" value="&lt;b&gt;After eks/configure, OpenTofu stops.&lt;/b&gt; The FluxInstance takes over and everything else in the cluster is reconciled from Git." style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
